* Discrete models used by the BaseChipOnly simulations
* MMBT3904 = 2N3904 die in SOT-23 (pinout B-E-C matches the Q_NPN_BEC footprint)
.model MMBT3904 NPN(IS=6.734f XTI=3 EG=1.11 VAF=74.03 BF=416.4 NE=1.259 ISE=6.734f IKF=66.78m
+ XTB=1.5 BR=.7371 NC=2 ISC=0 IKR=0 RC=1 CJC=3.638p MJC=.3085 VJC=.75 FC=.5 CJE=4.493p MJE=.2593
+ VJE=.75 TR=239.5n TF=301.2p ITF=.4 VTF=4 XTF=2 RB=10)
* SS34 Schottky 3 A / 40 V (typical-parameter model)
.model SS34 D(IS=15u RS=30m N=1.1 CJO=300p M=0.5 BV=40 IBV=1m TT=5n)
* 0805 indicator LEDs (typical): red ~2.0 V, white/blue ~3.0 V at 5 mA
.model LED_RED   D(IS=1e-19 N=1.8 RS=5 BV=5 IBV=10u CJO=20p)
.model LED_WHITE D(IS=1e-27 N=1.9 RS=8 BV=5 IBV=10u CJO=20p)
